📸Operators and Aggregation pipeline of mongodb
🧠Aggregation means:Taking many documents → processing them step-by-step → returning a transformed result
✅An aggregation pipeline consists of one or more stages that process documents.
//!user.controller line 383
✅The documents that a stage outputs are then passed to the next stage in the pipeline.
